  "title": "Split 1D Array — negative",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Split 1D Array — negative",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The second array starts at the split index. Indices outside the array clamp to its ends; elements are preserved.\n\nThe second array starts at the split index. Indices outside the array clamp to its ends; elements are preserved.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.array.owned@1.\nExpected:\nbefore (array<i32>) = []\nafter (array<i32>) = [1,2,3,4]\n",
